greybeard renames ponytail's skills, commands, hooks and settings, adds an
FP-leaning ruleset (domain types, lawful instances, errors as values) and
the `greybeard check` enforcement hook. The benchmark results under
benchmarks/results/ and the figures in skills/greybeard-gain were measured
on ponytail's ruleset, not greybeard's.
